9-4a43-ab67-172147ffc3c5.jpeg","caption":"About 13 minutes walk (800m) to the beach. Please look for signs of rip currents and avoid those areas."},{"url":"https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-4767141/original/fb37d331-4dcb-45b5-bb6d-c872c64a8b86.jpeg","caption":"About 12 minutes walk to PR413 (800m)"},{"url":"https://a0.muscache.com/im/pictures/hosting/Hosting-4767141/original/cb654b80-1432-44da-8202-658769d49d40.jpeg","caption":"Additional photos image 13"}],"description":"Imagine waking up to the sound of distant waves, opening the full-glass doors to disappear into a spectacular oceanview terrace while sipping your morning coffee or drink on the breezy covered terrace or hammocks, then spending your afternoon floating in your private pool or preparing your favorite meal in the custom bar with sink & BBQ. This isn't just a place to stay; it’s your own private tropical resort. Don't just dream about the perfect Caribbean escape, book today and make it a reality!The spaceOur OceanView Bungalow with private pool is nestled in a very peaceful neighborhood in Puntas Ward, up the hill from Sandy Beach, near bars and restaurants. You can delight with the amazing ocean view while enjoying your breakfast in the dining room or terrace! You can enjoy bird watching or relax in our open round terrace while enjoying the views. At night you can enjoy lots of stars! INTERIOR: Our house has vaulted ceilings, it has 2 bedrooms with A/C, 1 queen bed in each room and 1 Queen size sofa bed in the living room with ceiling fans. It has one full bathroom with a rain shower and hot water, a fully equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances. It also has a laundry closet with washer & dryer and a sink. It is equipped with a 600 galons water reserve tank and solar panels. Hot water is available in kitchen, laundry, bathroom and outdoor shower. Liiving room: Queen size sofa bed with a side table and a lamp. It has ceiling fans, no A/C.Dining room: Has a table with 6 chairs. There are also 2 barstools in the kitchen counter. It has ceiling fans, no A/C. There is a small desk with WIFI and a chair in the dining area. Bedroom 1: Has a Queen size bed, closet with hangers, iron board and iron, two night stand tables with lamps and a smart TV where you can log your personal streaming account.Bedroom 2: Has a Queen size bed with 2 nightstand tables with lamps, closet with hangers and a smart TV where you can log your personal streaming account. BACKYARDThe Backyard has a garden with several areas for you to enjoy. Covered terraceThe living/dining rooms has folding fullglass doors that opens to the covered terrace which has ocean view and is equipped with hammocks, a sofa set with coffee table and a dining set. Bar: adjacent to the terrace is a bar with 4 stool chairs overlooking the ocean and the garden. BBQ Area & Side PatioNext to the terrace is the side Patio, with a trellis ceiling that has a gas BBQ, a counter area with a bar sink. Outdoor shower and Bathroom: In the side patio it has a half bathroom and a separate outside shower. Pool Connected to the BBQ area is the pool with 2 built-in sitting areas. Please notice that you will have direct access to a swimming pool that is NOT GATED and has NO FENCE. Round Open Terrace The backyard has an open round terrace with chairs overlooking the ocean.Guest accessYou will have direct access to a swimming pool that is not gated and has No Fence. The pool is for the exclusive use of registered guests. No visitors are allowed. All minors will need extra supervision from a responsible adult and has to be accompanied with an adult at all times. Registered Guests has access to the full property, except for 2 closets that contained our stuff. Parking is on property, only 2 cars per reservation are allowed. If you have any questions please do not hesitate to ask.Other things to noteWIFI is often weak or intermittent. No refunds will be made for wifi, power/water outages and other things or situations that are out of our control. Late check out and early arrival if available has to be coordinated with host in advance, fees apply.If you want any additional cleaning during your stay or at check out please let us know at the time of booking, and we will be more than happy to arrange a housekeeper if available, for an additional fee.For safety, exterior cameras monitor the main entrance, side gate walkway, gate, and front yard. No cameras inside or in private areas. No audio is recorded. Cameras, Wi‑Fi, modules and gas sensors cannot be touched, moved, or unplugged.","latitude":18.36595,"longitude":-67.25383,"amenities":["Ocean view","Pool view","Bay view","Sea view","Garden view","Hair dryer","Cleaning products","Shampoo","Conditioner","Body soap","Outdoor shower","Hot water","Shower gel","Free washer – In unit","Free dryer – In unit","Essentials","Hangers","Bed linens","Extra pillows and blankets","Iron","Clothing storage: walk-in closet","Ethernet connection","55 inch HDTV","Books and reading material","Life size games","Board games","AC - split type ductless system","Ceiling fan","Portable fans","Exterior security cameras on property","Smoke alarm","Carbon monoxide alarm","Fire extinguisher","First aid kit","Wifi","Dedicated workspace","Kitchen","Refrigerator","Microwave","Cooking basics","Dishes and silverware","Freezer","Frigidaire stainless steel gas stove","Frigidaire - Gas stainless steel oven","Hot water kettle","Coffee maker: drip coffee maker","Wine glasses","Toaster","Baking sheet","Blender","Rice maker","Barbecue utensils","Dining table","Coffee","Shared beach access","Private entrance","Laundromat nearby","Private patio or balcony","Private backyard – Fully fenced","Outdoor furniture","Hammock","Outdoor dining area","Outdoor kitchen with sink","Private BBQ grill: gas","Beach essentials","Sun loungers","Free driveway parking on premises – 2 spaces","Free street parking","Private outdoor pool - available all year, open 24 hours","Single level home","Sel